# `railway up` does not honour .gitignore. Without this the CLI uploads the
# whole working tree — including a ~350 MB node_modules — and the deploy fails
# after "Uploading..." with no build log, which is indistinguishable from a
# build error. Everything here is either reinstalled or rebuilt in the image.
